All the values in loop are going to be converted into boolean 

Boolean has falsey & truthy values 

Truthy values are as follow:
empty array 
empty Objects

Falsey values are as follow [8]
empty
0
-0
o(n)
null NaN
undefined
false 

console.log(Boolean(1)) -> true
console.log(Boolean(0)) -> false

Fallback operator [|| this takes all falsey values]

let username = "Shruti"
console.log(username||"Shruti") non falsey
o/p : Shruti

let username = ""
console.log(username||"Shruti")  falsey is empty so it will fallback to Shruti
o/p: Shruti

?? operator take care of null & undefined
let username = 0
console.log(username ?? "Shruti")  0 ?? Shruti
o/p: 0

let username = NaN
console.log(username ?? "Shruti") ->   NaN ?? Shruti -> 
o/p: NaN
